<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_2_2_3" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-02">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_2_2_3">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_2_2_3" name="2.2.3 Hauling" processRef="Process_L3_2_2_3"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_2_2_3" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2/L3 Process. Truck executes loaded haul to assigned destination, dumps, and returns empty. Generates the majority of haul truck telemetry. Each complete cycle (spot → load → haul → dump → return) constitutes one haul_cycle entity instance.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_2_2_3">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_3_tr" name="Truck Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_2_2_3_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_2_3_gb</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_2_3_gd</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_2_3_gs</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_2_3_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_3_mc" name="Mine Controller / FMS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_o</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_4_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_3_d</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_2_3_x</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_2_2_3_s" name="Truck loaded and dispatched">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_1" name="2.2.3.1 Execute Loaded Haul">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck travels from dig face to assigned destination via the designated haul road. FMS continuously tracks GPS position, speed, and engine state at 1–5 second intervals. Strut pressures confirm loaded state throughout transit. Travel on the loaded haul constitutes Working Time (WT) per GMG TUM.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Truck Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (WT); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: haul_truck_gps_telemetry, haul_truck_engine_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gb" name="Breakdown en route?" default="Flow_L3_2_2_3_3">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gd" name="Override needed?" default="Flow_L3_2_2_3_5">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_5</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_2" name="2.2.3.2 Queue at Destination">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck arrives at destination area (crusher dump pocket, stockpile crest, waste dump face) and queues. Wait time classified as Operating Delay (OD) if brief, or Operating Standby (SBO) if extended by management decision (crusher shutdown, access congestion). Classification must be made explicitly per event.
ISA-95 level: 3 / 2
Actors: Truck Operator; Mine Controller
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (OD or SBO — same critical distinction as at shovel); ISA-95 Level 3
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (delay_event with TUM classification)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_3" name="2.2.3.3 Spot Truck at Dump Location">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck leaves the queue and manoeuvres into dump position at the crusher pocket lip, stockpile crest, or waste dump edge. Dump spotting requires precise positioning relative to safety berms and dump edge geometry. Spotting is NP (Non-Productive). FMS and/or proximity sensors detect dump position arrival.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Truck Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (NP — spotting at destination); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_4" name="2.2.3.4 Dump Load">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck operator raises the truck body using the hydraulic dump system, depositing load at destination. Strut pressure drop confirms payload release (empty state). FMS records dump event timestamp (UTC) and destination location. Dumping constitutes the productive work completion of the haul cycle.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Truck Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (WT — dumping is productive function); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (haul_cycle — dump event closes cycle)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gs" name="Stockpile dump?" default="Flow_L3_2_2_3_11">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_12</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_5" name="2.2.3.5 Execute Empty Return">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck body lowered; truck travels empty from destination back to assigned dig face (or new face as dispatched by FMS). Empty return is Non-Productive Operating Time (NP). FMS may reassign destination during empty return via dynamic dispatch. Return arrival at the shovel/face closes the haul cycle loop.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Truck Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (NP — empty return); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw (telemetry continues); Curated (haul_cycle closed)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_13</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_2_3_e" name="Haul cycle closed at face">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_14</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_o" name="Override destination (reason code)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 1 process 1.4.3.2 (Handle Destination Override). The destination was assigned at 2.2.2.4 from the plan; FMS or the mine controller changes it at runtime (crusher full, grade control reclassification, road closure). Override logged with reason code; any resulting queue is classified against GMG TUM (OD/SBO).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_4_1" name="2.2.4.1 Build ROM Stockpile">
      <bpmn:documentation>Haul trucks dump ore material at designated stockpile zones. Mine controller tracks which trucks dump to which zone per material classification. Physical stockpile volume surveyed periodically by drone or GPS. Mass delivered estimated from haul cycle payload records (sum per shift per zone). This is an internal custody transfer point: Mine Operations to Processing.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 3
Actors: Mine Controller; Survey Team
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 3; AMIRA P754 Principle 5 (custody transfer measurement)
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (stockpile_inventory)
Executed here, as the stockpile branch of the destination decision. The truck dump event (2.2.3.4) is the physical build; this step credits the tonnes to the stockpile zone.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_3_d" name="Classify breakdown as TUM: DT">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_3_15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_2_3_x" name="Haul cycle suspended">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_3_15</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_2_2_3_s" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_1" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gb"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_3" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gb" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gd"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gb" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_d"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_5" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gd" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_6" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gd" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_o"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_7" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_o" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_8" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_2" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_9" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_3" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_10" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_4" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gs"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_11" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gs" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_5"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_12" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_3_gs" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_4_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_13" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_4_1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_5"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_14" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_2_2_3_5" targetRef="End_L3_2_2_3_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_3_15" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_3_d" targetRef="End_L3_2_2_3_x"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_2_2_3">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_2_2_3" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_2_2_3">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_2_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_2_2_3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1834" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_3_tr_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_3_tr" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1794" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
